-- ============= ABUNDANCE & PROSPERITY (Phase 6) =============

-- 005 - I Am Open to Receive (NOVICE)
(
  gen_random_uuid(),
  'I Am Open to Receive',
  'Declaration of openness to divine abundance and provision.',
  E'I STAND IN THE TRUTH OF ABUNDANCE.\n\nScarcity is not my origin. Lack is not my inheritance. I was born into a universe that overflows.\n\nThe apple tree does not count its fruit. The river does not hoard its water. The sun does not ration its light.\n\nAnd I...I am part of this same creation. Abundance is woven into my very design.\n\nI release every belief that says there is not enough. I release every fear that whispers I will run out. I release the frequency of lack...and I tune my antenna to overflow.\n\nYeshua said...Ask and it shall be given. Seek and you shall find. Knock and it shall be opened.\n\nSo today...I ask with confidence. I seek with expectation. I knock knowing the door is already opening.\n\nI do not chase abundance. I align with it. I do not beg for provision. I receive it.\n\nMy hands are open. My heart is open. My life is open to the overflow.\n\nMoney flows to me easily. Opportunities find me effortlessly. Resources arrive in expected and unexpected ways.\n\nI am a magnet for prosperity...not because I strain for it...but because I resonate with it.\n\nThe Kingdom is within me. And in the Kingdom...there is no lack.\n\nI am abundant. I am prosperous. I am supplied.\n\nAnd so it is.',
  'prayers/i-am-open-to-receive.m4a',
  0,
  'novice',
  ARRAY['finance', 'career', 'personalGrowth'],
  ARRAY['abundance', 'receiving', 'prosperity', 'openness'],
