-- ============= SELF-WORTH & IDENTITY (Phase 1 + Phase 5) =============

-- 009 - I Am Worthy (NOVICE)
(
  gen_random_uuid(),
  'I Am Worthy',
  'Declaration of inherent worthiness and divine identity.',
  E'I STAND IN THE TRUTH OF WHO I AM.\n\nNot who I was told I am. Not who fear says I am. Not who failure tried to make me.\n\nI am who I was created to be. And that is enough.\n\nI release the lie that I must earn my worth. I release the belief that I am not enough. I release the voice that says I need to be more...do more...prove more.\n\nMy worth is not negotiable. It is not up for debate. It was settled before I took my first breath.\n\nYeshua said I am the light of the world. Not I could become the light. Not I might one day be the light. I am the light.\n\nAnd light does not apologize for shining.\n\nI am not my mistakes. I am not my past. I am not the worst thing I have ever done.\n\nI am a soul having a human experience. I am consciousness wrapped in skin. I am the Kingdom walking the earth.\n\nToday I choose to see myself as I truly am. Not through the lens of comparison. Not through the eyes of those who could not see my value. But through the eyes of the One who formed me.\n\nI am worthy of love. I am worthy of success. I am worthy of peace. I am worthy of good things.\n\nNot because I have earned them. But because I exist.\n\nMy identity is not what I do. My identity is who I am. And who I am is whole.\n\nI am enough. I have always been enough. I will always be enough.\n\nAnd so it is.',
  'prayers/i-am-worthy.m4a',
  0,
  'novice',
  ARRAY['personalGrowth', 'relationships'],
  ARRAY['worthiness', 'identity', 'self-love', 'value'],
  14
),

