-- ============= FORGIVENESS & RELEASE (Phase 4) =============

-- 013 - I Choose to Release (NOVICE)
(
  gen_random_uuid(),
  'I Choose to Release',
  'Declaration choosing forgiveness as a gift to self.',
  E'I STAND IN THE TRUTH OF FREEDOM.\n\nI have carried weights that were never mine to hold. Resentments that poisoned only me. Memories that played on repeat...keeping me trapped in a moment that has already passed.\n\nToday...I choose release.\n\nI forgive. Not because what happened was okay. Not because the pain wasn''t real. But because I refuse to let the past hold my future hostage.\n\nForgiveness is not a gift I give to those who hurt me. Forgiveness is a gift I give to myself.\n\nI release the person who wounded me. I release them from the debt I thought they owed. I release myself from the role of judge and jailer.\n\nI am not meant to carry this.\n\nI release the anger that has lived in my body. I release the bitterness that has poisoned my thoughts. I release the replaying of moments I cannot change.\n\nThe past is over. It holds no power except what I give it. And today...I take my power back.\n\nI forgive myself. For the mistakes I made. For the times I knew better and didn''t do better. For the ways I betrayed my own heart.\n\nI was doing the best I could with what I had. And that is enough.\n\nYeshua said...Forgive and you will be forgiven. Release and you will be released.\n\nSo I forgive. And I am forgiven. I release. And I am released.\n\nMy hands are open. My heart is open. The chains are falling away.\n\nI am free. I am light. I am at peace.\n\nAnd so it is.',
  'prayers/i-choose-to-release.m4a',
  0,
  'novice',
  ARRAY['personalGrowth', 'health', 'relationships'],
  ARRAY['forgiveness', 'release', 'freedom', 'peace'],
  16
),

