-- 017 - I Am at Peace (NOVICE)
(
  gen_random_uuid(),
  'I Am at Peace',
  'Declaration of peace as birthright, releasing anxiety and control.',
  E'I STAND IN THE TRUTH OF PEACE.\n\nNot peace that depends on circumstances. Not peace that waits until everything is resolved. Peace that exists in the midst of the storm. Peace that is my birthright.\n\nI was not given a spirit of fear. I was given a spirit of power...of love...and of a sound mind.\n\nFear is not my master. Anxiety is not my home. Worry is not my identity.\n\nI am a child of peace. And peace lives within me.\n\nI release the need to control what I cannot control. I release the obsession with outcomes. I release the replaying of worst case scenarios.\n\nThese habits have exhausted me. They have stolen my present moment. They have robbed me of joy.\n\nToday...I choose differently.\n\nI breathe in peace. I breathe out fear. I breathe in courage. I breathe out doubt.\n\nYeshua said...Peace I leave with you. My peace I give unto you. Not as the world gives do I give. Let not your heart be troubled...neither let it be afraid.\n\nSo I receive this peace. A peace that passes understanding. A peace that guards my heart and mind. A peace that the world cannot take away.\n\nI am calm in chaos. I am steady in uncertainty. I am anchored in something deeper than circumstances.\n\nFear may knock at my door. But I do not have to let it in. I acknowledge it. I thank it for trying to protect me. And I choose peace instead.\n\nI am brave. I am strong. I am held. I am at peace.\n\nAnd so it is.',
  'prayers/i-am-at-peace.m4a',
  0,
  'novice',
  ARRAY['health', 'spirituality'],
  ARRAY['peace', 'anxiety', 'calm', 'courage'],
  18
),

