-- 021 - I Am Grateful (NOVICE)
(
  gen_random_uuid(),
  'I Am Grateful',
  'Declaration of gratitude for breath, body, provision, and people.',
  E'I STAND IN THE TRUTH OF GRATITUDE.\n\nNot gratitude that waits for perfect circumstances. Not gratitude that comes only when I get what I want. Gratitude that exists right here...right now...in the midst of the unfinished and the imperfect.\n\nI am grateful.\n\nI am grateful for the breath in my lungs. I am grateful for the heart beating in my chest. I am grateful for the body that carries me through this life.\n\nI am grateful for the roof over my head. I am grateful for the food that nourishes me. I am grateful for the water that sustains me.\n\nI am grateful for the people who love me. I am grateful for the strangers who have shown me kindness. I am grateful even for those who challenged me...for they taught me who I am.\n\nWhat I appreciate...appreciates. What I focus on...expands. So I focus on blessings. And blessings multiply.\n\nI choose to see abundance instead of lack. I choose to notice what is working instead of what is broken. I choose to celebrate progress instead of obsessing over perfection.\n\nGratitude is not just a feeling. It is a frequency. And I am tuning myself to that frequency now.\n\nI am grateful for what I have. I am grateful for what is coming. I am grateful for this moment...exactly as it is.\n\nJoy is my birthright. Happiness is not something I chase. It is something I choose. And today...I choose joy.\n\nThank you. Thank you. Thank you.\n\nAnd so it is.',
  'prayers/i-am-grateful.m4a',
  0,
