-- 037 - The Kingdom Is Within Me (NOVICE)
(
  gen_random_uuid(),
  'The Kingdom Is Within Me',
  'Declaration of Kingdom within, turning inward to sacred presence.',
  E'I STAND IN THE TRUTH OF MY SPIRITUAL NATURE.\n\nBefore I speak...I take a breath...and I remember what I am.\n\nI am not just a body. I am not just a mind. I am not just my thoughts or my emotions.\n\nI am a soul having a human experience. I am spirit clothed in flesh. I am the infinite temporarily wearing the finite.\n\nThe Kingdom of God is within me. Not in a building made of stone. Not in a ritual performed on certain days. Not in a distant heaven I must earn my way into.\n\nWithin me. Right here. Right now. Already present. Already complete.\n\nYeshua spoke these words...The Kingdom of God cometh not with observation. Neither shall they say lo here or lo there. For behold...the Kingdom of God is within you.\n\nI have been searching outside for what has always been inside. Running to experiences hoping to feel connected. Chasing teachers who might show me the way. Looking everywhere except where the treasure was hidden.\n\nBut today I turn inward. Today I remember the truth.\n\nI turn toward the sacred space within me. The sanctuary that needs no building. The temple that needs no walls. The holy ground that is my own heart.\n\nHere...the Divine dwells. Here...all wisdom resides. Here...I am never alone. Here...I am always held. Here...I am always loved.\n\nI am connected. Not because I have done the right things. Not because I have believed the right beliefs. Not because I have earned this connection through effort.\n\nI am connected because connection is my nature. I am connected because I am made of the Divine. I am connected because separation was always an illusion.\n\nThe same presence that spins galaxies...lives within me. The same intelligence that grows forests...guides my steps. The same love that created everything...flows through my veins.\n\nI do not need to earn this connection. I do not need to be worthy of this presence. I was born with it. It is my birthright. It is the truth of what I am.\n\nI breathe in...and I receive divine presence. I breathe out...and I release the illusion of separation.\n\nThere is no distance between me and the Sacred. There never was. Only forgetting. Only distraction. Only the noise of the world drowning out the whisper within.\n\nBut I hear it now. I feel it now. I know it now.\n\nI am spiritual by nature. I am connected at my core. I am held in every moment. I am never...ever...alone.\n\nThe Kingdom is within me.\n\nNamaste. And so it is.',
  'prayers/the-kingdom-is-within-me.m4a',
  0,
  'novice',
  ARRAY['spirituality', 'personalGrowth'],
  ARRAY['kingdom', 'within', 'divine', 'presence', 'connection'],
